cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the datasets, please cite the paper below."
title: "LLM Abstention Can Be a Prompt Artifact, in Addition to Genuine Uncertainty"
abstract: >-
  Adding an "Unknown" option to a True/False question makes a model abstain on
  questions it can otherwise answer. This repository holds the code and datasets
  behind that finding, which we call Abstention Inflation.
type: software
